sentences.t:
tum pendere poenas
Cecropidae iussi—miserum!—septena quotannis
corpora natorum;

sentences.l:
then to pay the penalty the Cecropidae,
ordered — wretched! — seven each year,
bodies of sons;

sentences.t:
hic crudelis amor tauri, suppostaque furto
Pasiphaë, mixtumque genus prolesque biformis
Minotaurus inest, Veneris monumenta nefandae;

sentences.l:
here the cruel love of the bull, and Pasiphae set beneath it
by a trick, and the mixed breed and two-formed offspring,
the Minotaur, are inside, memorials of an unspeakable Venus;

sentences.t:
”Cui talia fanti
ante fores subito non voltus, non color unus,
non comptae mansere comae;

sentences.l:
to her speaking such things before the doors, suddenly, not one countenance,
not one colour, not her dressed hair
remained;

sentences.t:
At, Phoebi nondum patiens, immanis in antro
bacchatur vates, magnum si pectore possit
excussisse deum;

sentences.l:
But, not yet enduring Phoebus, huge in the cave
the seer raves, in case she can shake from her breast
the great god;
